    %% Manager path
    SA_Manager -->|bound via| CRB_Manager
    CRB_Manager -->|grants| CR_Manager
    CR_Manager -->|"CRUD + watch"| R_CM
    CR_Manager -->|"CRUD + watch"| R_SA
    CR_Manager -->|"CRUD + watch"| R_Pods
